necessity of the past, but the necessity of the timeless realm. So the
first three steps of the argument would be reformulated as
follows:</p>

<dl class="sentag tag3em">
<dt>(1t)</dt>
<dd>God timelessly knows <em>T</em>.</dd>
<dt>(2t)</dt>
<dd>If <em>E</em> is in the timeless realm, then it is now-necessary
that <em>E</em>.</dd>
<dt>(3t)</dt>
<dd>It is now-necessary that <em>T</em>.</dd>
</dl>

<p>
Perhaps it is inappropriate to say that timeless events such as
