pain of begging the question against libertarians), or it
<em>doesnâ€™t</em> causally determine Jonesâ€™s decision, in
which case Blackâ€™s non-intervention leaves Jones free to decide
otherwise and he <em>is</em> morally responsible for murdering Smith.
Either way, PAP gives just the right result (Widerker 1995b).
Considerable debate has arisen over whether the flickers featured in
