mimics FSCs. That assumption may be unwarranted. Augustineâ€™s
counterexample to PAP was divine foreknowledge itself, not a
proto-Frankfurtian thought experiment featuring a counterfactual
intervener. Since God infallibly believed yesterday that you will
answer the phone at 9:00 am tomorrow, there is no alternative
