theyâ€™re disanalogous to infallible foreknowledge cases. The
flicker defense exploits the presence or absence of the sign that
would trigger the counterfactual intervener. Whether or not the sign
appears is not up to Blackâ€”thatâ€™s the flicker of freedom
that Black cannot extinguish. But Godâ€™s foreknowledge
doesnâ€™t come online only after a counterfactual trigger; it was
